   "img": "05.jpg",
   "text": "First Edition, 1907"
  },
  {
   "img": "06.jpg",
   "text": "JOHNNY CROW'S PARTY"
  },
  {
   "img": "07.jpg",
   "text": "Johnny Crow Plied Rake and Hoe"
  },
  {
   "img": "08.jpg",
   "text": "And improved his little Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "09.jpg",
   "text": "And the Eagle"
  },
  {
   "img": "10.jpg",
   "text": "Looked quite regal"
  },
  {
   "img": "11.jpg",
   "text": "In Johnny Crow's Garden"
  },
  {
   "img": "12.jpg",
   "text": "And the Cockatoo Said \"Comment vous portez vous?\""
  },
  {
   "img": "13.jpg",
   "text": "And the Gander"
  },
  {
   "img": "14.jpg",
   "text": "Didn't understand her;"
  },
  {
   "img": "15.jpg",
   "text": "But the Flamingo Talked the same lingo"
  },
  {
   "img": "16.jpg",
   "text": "In Johnny Crow's Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "17.jpg",
   "text": "And the Bear"
  },
  {
   "img": "18.jpg",
   "text": "Sang a sentimental Air,"
  },
  {
   "img": "19.jpg",
   "text": "But the Giraffe Was inclined to laugh;"
  },
  {
   "img": "20.jpg",
   "text": "Even the Duckling Couldn't help chuckling In Johnny Crow's Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "21.jpg",
   "text": "Then the Snake"
  },
  {
   "img": "22.jpg",
   "text": "Got entangled with the rake"
  },
  {
   "img": "23.jpg",
   "text": "In Johnny Crow's Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "24.jpg",
   "text": "And the Cock"
  },
  {
   "img": "25.jpg",
   "text": "Had a very nasty knock;"
  },
  {
   "img": "26.jpg",
   "text": "So the Hen Said:"
  },
  {
   "img": "27.jpg",
   "text": "\"We'll never come again"
  },
  {
   "img": "28.jpg",
   "text": "To Johnny Crow's Garden!\""
  },
  {
   "img": "29.jpg",
   "text": "And the Sheep"
  },
  {
   "img": "30.jpg",
   "text": "Went to sleep,"
  },
  {
   "img": "31.jpg",
   "text": "And the Armadillo"
  },
  {
   "img": "32.jpg",
   "text": "Used him for a pillow;"
  },
  {
   "img": "33.jpg",
   "text": "And the Porcupine"
  },
  {
   "img": "34.jpg",
   "text": "Said: \"Wake me if for talk you pine!\""
  },
  {
   "img": "35.jpg",
   "text": "In Johnny Crow's"
  },
  {
   "img": "36.jpg",
   "text": "Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "37.jpg",
   "text": "And the Kangaroo"
  },
  {
   "img": "38.jpg",
   "text": "Tried to paint the Roses blue"
  },
  {
   "img": "39.jpg",
   "text": "Till the Camel Swallowed the Enamel."
  },
  {
   "img": "40.jpg",
   "text": "And the Reindeer Said: \"I'm sorry for your pain, dear!\""
  },
  {
   "img": "41.jpg",
   "text": "In Johnny Crow's Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "42.jpg",
   "text": "So the Chimpanzee Put the Kettle on for Tea;"
  },
  {
   "img": "43.jpg",
   "text": "And the Seal"
  },
  {
   "img": "44.jpg",
   "text": "Made a very big Meal;"
  },
  {
   "img": "45.jpg",
   "text": "While the Sole Shared a Muffin with the Mole In Johnny Crow's Garden."
  },
  {
   "img": "46.jpg",
   "text": "Then they picked the Flowers, and wandered in the Maze, And before they went their several ways"
  },
  {
   "img": "47.jpg",
   "text": "They all joined together In a Hearty Vote of Praise"
  },
  {
   "img": "48.jpg",
   "text": "Of Johnny Crow and his Garden."
  },
  {
